   "title": "Find r",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Use the distance formula for P(−3, 4).}\\\\[5pt]&r=\\sqrt{(-3)^2+4^2}=\\sqrt{25}=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{5}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
