   "title": "Ratios of θ",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\sin\\theta=\\dfrac yr=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{\\dfrac45}}\\\\[5pt]&\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac xr=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{-\\dfrac35}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
